{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-structure","title":"高一生物 — 细胞结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/cell-biology-adv/cell-structure","wordCount":1985,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一生物-细胞结构\">高一生物 — 细胞结构</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>如果把细胞比作一座工厂，那么细胞膜就是工厂的围墙和门卫，细胞核是总控制室，线粒体是发电车间，核糖体是生产线上的装配机器。每一种细胞器都有独特的结构和功能，它们各司其职又紧密协作，共同维持着细胞这个生命基本单位的正常运转。从原核细胞到真核细胞，从动物细胞到植物细胞，细胞结构的多样性反映了生物适应不同生存环境的演化策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-细胞的基本结构层次\">一、细胞的基本结构层次</h3><p>真核细胞由三个基本部分组成：<strong>细胞膜</strong>、<strong>细胞质</strong>和<strong>细胞核</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[真核细胞] --&gt; B[细胞膜]&#10;    A --&gt; C[细胞质]&#10;    A --&gt; D[细胞核]&#10;    C --&gt; E[细胞质基质]&#10;    C --&gt; F[细胞器]&#10;    F --&gt; G[线粒体]&#10;    F --&gt; H[内质网]&#10;    F --&gt; I[高尔基体]&#10;    F --&gt; J[核糖体]&#10;    F --&gt; K[溶酶体]&#10;    F --&gt; L[叶绿体/植物]&#10;    F --&gt; M[液泡/植物]\">graph TD\n    A[真核细胞] --&gt; B[细胞膜]\n    A --&gt; C[细胞质]\n    A --&gt; D[细胞核]\n    C --&gt; E[细胞质基质]\n    C --&gt; F[细胞器]\n    F --&gt; G[线粒体]\n    F --&gt; H[内质网]\n    F --&gt; I[高尔基体]\n    F --&gt; J[核糖体]\n    F --&gt; K[溶酶体]\n    F --&gt; L[叶绿体/植物]\n    F --&gt; M[液泡/植物]</pre><h3 id=\"二-细胞膜-生命系统的边界\">二、细胞膜——生命系统的边界</h3><p><strong>化学组成</strong>：磷脂双分子层为基本骨架，蛋白质镶嵌其中，外侧有糖蛋白。</p>\n<p><strong>流动镶嵌模型</strong>（Singer 和 Nicolson，1972年提出）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>磷脂分子以亲水头朝外、疏水尾朝内的方式排成双层</li>\n<li>蛋白质有的嵌入磷脂双层，有的横跨整个膜，有的附着在膜表面</li>\n<li>整个结构具有<strong>流动性</strong>——磷脂分子和蛋白质可以侧向运动</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>细胞膜的功能</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保护作用</td>\n<td>将细胞与外界环境分隔开</td>\n<td>维持细胞内环境稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制物质进出</td>\n<td>选择透过性，让有用物质进入、废物排出</td>\n<td>葡萄糖的主动运输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞间信息交流</td>\n<td>通过受体接收信号分子</td>\n<td>激素与靶细胞受体结合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>物质跨膜运输方式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>是否需要载体</th>\n<th>是否消耗能量</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自由扩散</td>\n<td>高浓度→低浓度</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、水分子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协助扩散</td>\n<td>高浓度→低浓度</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>红细胞吸收葡萄糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动运输</td>\n<td>低浓度→高浓度</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（ATP）</td>\n<td>小肠上皮细胞吸收氨基酸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-细胞核-遗传信息的控制中心\">三、细胞核——遗传信息的控制中心</h3><p><strong>结构组成</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核膜</td>\n<td>双层膜，将核内物质与细胞质分隔，上有核孔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核孔</td>\n<td>大分子物质（如mRNA）进出的通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核仁</td>\n<td>与核糖体RNA（rRNA）的合成有关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>染色质/染色体</td>\n<td>DNA与蛋白质的复合物，是遗传信息的载体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>细胞核的功能</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>储存遗传信息（DNA）</li>\n<li>控制细胞的代谢和遗传</li>\n<li>是细胞代谢和遗传的控制中心</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实验证据</strong>：变形虫切割实验——去核的部分很快死亡，保留核的部分能再生并正常生活。伞藻嫁接实验——伞藻的&quot;帽&quot;的形状由细胞核中的遗传物质决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-细胞质中的主要细胞器\">四、细胞质中的主要细胞器</h3><p><strong>（一）线粒体——细胞的&quot;动力工厂&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>结构：双层膜结构，内膜向内折叠形成嵴，增大了表面积。内含少量DNA和核糖体。</p>\n<p>功能：进行<strong>有氧呼吸</strong>的主要场所。将有机物（如葡萄糖）氧化分解，释放能量并合成ATP。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>→</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>能量（ATP）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 + 6\\text{O}_2 + 6\\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\to 6\\text{CO}_2 + 12\\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{能量（ATP）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">能量（</span><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>（二）叶绿体——光合作用的场所（植物细胞特有）</strong></p>\n<p>结构：双层膜，内有类囊体堆叠形成的基粒和基质。类囊体薄膜上有光合色素。含少量DNA和核糖体。</p>\n<p>功能：进行<strong>光合作用</strong>，将光能转化为化学能，合成有机物。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>光</mtext></mpadded></mover><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\text{CO}_2 + 12\\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\xrightarrow{\\text{光}} \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 + 6\\text{O}_2 + 6\\text{H}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">光</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>（三）内质网</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粗面内质网</strong>：表面附着核糖体，参与蛋白质的加工和运输</li>\n<li><strong>滑面内质网</strong>：无核糖体，参与脂质合成和解毒</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>（四）高尔基体</strong></p>\n<p>功能：蛋白质的进一步加工、分类和包装运输。在植物细胞中还与细胞壁的形成有关。</p>\n<p><strong>（五）核糖体</strong></p>\n<p>结构：无膜结构，由蛋白质和rRNA组成。</p>\n<p>功能：蛋白质合成的场所。分为游离核糖体（合成细胞内蛋白）和附着核糖体（合成分泌蛋白）。</p>\n<p><strong>（六）溶酶体</strong></p>\n<p>功能：内含多种水解酶，能分解衰老的细胞器和侵入细胞的病原体——被称为细胞内的&quot;消化车间&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-细胞器之间的分工合作-以分泌蛋白的合成与运输为例\">五、细胞器之间的分工合作——以分泌蛋白的合成与运输为例</h3><p>分泌蛋白（如消化酶、抗体）的合成和分泌过程，体现了多种细胞器之间的协调配合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[核糖体:合成多肽链] --&gt; B[内质网:初步加工、折叠]&#10;    B --&gt; C[高尔基体:进一步加工、分类包装]&#10;    C --&gt; D[细胞膜:胞吐分泌到细胞外]\">graph LR\n    A[核糖体:合成多肽链] --&gt; B[内质网:初步加工、折叠]\n    B --&gt; C[高尔基体:进一步加工、分类包装]\n    C --&gt; D[细胞膜:胞吐分泌到细胞外]</pre><p>整个过程需要<strong>线粒体</strong>提供ATP（能量），<strong>内质网</strong>提供膜泡运输载体。这体现了生物膜系统（内质网膜、高尔基体膜、细胞膜）在功能上的联系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-动物细胞与植物细胞的比较\">六、动物细胞与植物细胞的比较</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>植物细胞</th>\n<th>动物细胞</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细胞壁</td>\n<td>有（纤维素和果胶）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶绿体</td>\n<td>有（含叶绿素的细胞）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>液泡</td>\n<td>有（大液泡，成熟细胞）</td>\n<td>无或极小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心体</td>\n<td>无（高等植物）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞膜</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线粒体</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内质网</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核糖体</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"七-原核细胞与真核细胞的比较\">七、原核细胞与真核细胞的比较</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>原核细胞</th>\n<th>真核细胞</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细胞大小</td>\n<td>较小（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{ }\\mu\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>较大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{ }\\mu\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有无核膜</td>\n<td>无（拟核区域）</td>\n<td>有（真正的细胞核）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>染色体</td>\n<td>无（裸露的环状DNA）</td>\n<td>有（DNA与蛋白质结合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞器</td>\n<td>仅有核糖体</td>\n<td>种类多样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表生物</td>\n<td>细菌、蓝藻</td>\n<td>动物、植物、真菌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>绘制一个典型的动物细胞结构示意图，标注细胞膜、细胞核、线粒体、内质网、高尔基体、核糖体和溶酶体。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么线粒体被称为细胞的&quot;动力工厂&quot;，叶绿体被称为&quot;养料制造车间&quot;。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分泌蛋白从合成到分泌需要经过哪些细胞器？简述每个细胞器在这一过程中的作用。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>植物细胞有细胞壁而动物细胞没有，这对两种细胞的功能有什么影响？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：线粒体和叶绿体为什么拥有自己的DNA？这与&quot;内共生学说&quot;有什么关系？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>内共生学说认为，线粒体和叶绿体起源于被早期真核细胞吞噬的原核生物——线粒体可能来自古代的好氧细菌，叶绿体可能来自古代的蓝藻。这两种细胞器拥有自己的DNA（环状）、核糖体（70S型，与细菌相同）和双层膜结构（内膜来自原始细菌的细胞膜，外膜来自宿主细胞的吞噬泡），这些特征都强烈支持内共生假说。2016年的基因组研究进一步证实，线粒体与变形菌门（Alphaproteobacteria）有着密切的亲缘关系。内共生是进化史上最重要的事件之一，正是线粒体的加入使真核细胞获得了高效的有氧呼吸能力，为多细胞生物的进化铺平了道路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>真核细胞由细胞膜、细胞质和细胞核三大部分组成。细胞膜以流动镶嵌模型为结构基础，具有保护、控制物质进出和信息交流三大功能。细胞核是遗传信息的控制中心。细胞质中的各种细胞器分工合作：线粒体提供能量，叶绿体进行光合作用，核糖体合成蛋白质，内质网和高尔基体负责加工和运输，溶酶体负责消化分解。分泌蛋白的合成与运输过程体现了生物膜系统的协调配合。区分动物细胞与植物细胞、原核细胞与真核细胞的结构差异，是理解生物多样性的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一生物 — 细胞结构","id":"高一生物-细胞结构"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、细胞的基本结构层次","id":"一-细胞的基本结构层次"},{"level":3,"text":"二、细胞膜——生命系统的边界","id":"二-细胞膜-生命系统的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"三、细胞核——遗传信息的控制中心","id":"三-细胞核-遗传信息的控制中心"},{"level":3,"text":"四、细胞质中的主要细胞器","id":"四-细胞质中的主要细胞器"},{"level":3,"text":"五、细胞器之间的分工合作——以分泌蛋白的合成与运输为例","id":"五-细胞器之间的分工合作-以分泌蛋白的合成与运输为例"},{"level":3,"text":"六、动物细胞与植物细胞的比较","id":"六-动物细胞与植物细胞的比较"},{"level":3,"text":"七、原核细胞与真核细胞的比较","id":"七-原核细胞与真核细胞的比较"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一生物 — 蛋白质与核酸","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/molecular-biology/proteins-nucleic-acids"},"next":{"title":"高一生物 — 细胞代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/cell-biology-adv/cell-metabolism"}}